SUMMARY:Collection in Focus: 19th Century Canadian Ceramics
DESCRIPTION:Collection in Focus: 19th Century Canadian Ceramics            \n                                    \n                                \n                        \n                                                \n                                                        Get Tickets                        \n                                            \n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n	\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n	\n\n\n			\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Wednesday September 9\, 2026\n6:00 pm – 7:00 pm\n \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    The Gardiner Museum stewards a collection of over 5\,000 pieces\, approximately half of which are on view across our galleries. This program brings into focus the Museum’s collection of Canadian Ceramics from the 1800s\, on display for the first time in our new Community Learning Centre. \nIn an intimate talk\, Jasmin Khalil\, Curatorial Research and Interpretation Intern\, will share her research into the utilitarian and decorative wares produced by early settler potters in Canada\, followed by an object handling session that offers a rare opportunity to get up close and personal with this unique collection. Space is limited! \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n\n        \n          \n          \n                        \n               \n                Gardiner Friends : $17\n                                        \n                        \n               \n                General : $20\n                                        \n                      \n\n           \n            \n              Gardiner Friends\, log in to access your discount.* \nNot a Gardiner Friend yet? Join now at the Friend level or above to save . \n*Discounts on programs and classes do not apply to ‘Annual Pass’ level. \n            \n                    \n          \n            \n  \n            \n                \n                                    SOLD OUT\n                \n                            \n           \n                \n                \n                    \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n          \n          \n        \n\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/collection-in-focus-19th-century-canadian-ceramics/
LOCATION:Gardiner Museum\, 111 Queen's Park\, Toronto\, ON\, M5S 2C7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Programs & Events
